{"page":288,"width":1736,"height":2345,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"던 2개의 검은색 중 하나를 부모 노드인 A에게 넘깁니다. 여기까지만 하면 원래의 이중 혹책 노드","words":[{"text":"던","x":228,"y":180,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"2개의","x":273,"y":179,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"검은색","x":373,"y":179,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"중","x":474,"y":181,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"하나를","x":515,"y":179,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"부모","x":612,"y":179,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"노드인","x":681,"y":177,"width":87,"height":31},{"text":"A에게","x":780,"y":177,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"넘깁니다.","x":876,"y":178,"width":122,"height":32},{"text":"여기까지만","x":1015,"y":176,"width":145,"height":34},{"text":"하면","x":1171,"y":176,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"원래의","x":1243,"y":177,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"이중","x":1344,"y":176,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"혹책","x":1415,"y":175,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"노드","x":1490,"y":178,"width":65,"height":25}]},{"text":"였던 c에 대한 처리가 끝납니다. 부모 노드인 A는 자기가 넘겨받은 검은색을 적절하게 잘 처리하면","words":[{"text":"였던","x":228,"y":240,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"c에","x":303,"y":240,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"대한","x":374,"y":240,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"처리가","x":446,"y":241,"width":88,"height":31},{"text":"끝납니다.","x":543,"y":240,"width":121,"height":32},{"text":"부모","x":677,"y":240,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"노드인","x":744,"y":239,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"A는","x":841,"y":241,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"자기가","x":904,"y":240,"width":89,"height":32},{"text":"넘겨받은","x":1003,"y":240,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"검은색을","x":1129,"y":240,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"적절하게","x":1257,"y":240,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"잘","x":1385,"y":240,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"처리하면","x":1427,"y":239,"width":124,"height":35}]},{"text":"됩니다. A는 빨간색 노드이므로 형제 노-드를 볼 필요도 없습니다. A 노드만 검은색으로 칠해주면","words":[{"text":"됩니다.","x":226,"y":301,"width":106,"height":33},{"text":"A는","x":349,"y":303,"width":59,"height":30},{"text":"빨간색","x":421,"y